# The build Allowlist: the only domains the Base image build may reach,
# through the Egress proxy that `p4a image build` starts (ADR 0003).
# One domain per line; "*.example.com" allows any subdomain of example.com.
# Kept here, not in either image, so only a reviewed change to podman4ai
# can widen it.

# Debian packages and security updates (apt, plain HTTP)
deb.debian.org

# Claude Code's native installer and its downloads
claude.ai
downloads.claude.ai

# Node's releases
nodejs.org

# gh's apt repository
cli.github.com

# Latest-release lookups and release downloads for uv, ruff, ty, Bun and
# git-delta (GitHub redirects each download to its asset host)
github.com
release-assets.githubusercontent.com
